1 bend knees and turn torso slightly, hand travels across the lower back;
2 pass-miming hand wraps behind waist toward image-left, shoulders rotate away from target;
3 RELEASE at simulation tick7: arm snaps behind the back toward image-left, wrist flicked and palm empty;
